走</span><span>不</span><span>了</span><span>几</span><span>步</span><span>，</span><span>就</span><span>无</span><span>法</span><span>忍</span><span>受</span><span>痛</span><span>苦</span><span>掉</span><span>进</span><span>火</span><span>海</span><span>，</span><span>被</span><span>活</span><span>活</span><span>烧</span><span>死</span><span>。</span></p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span>商</span><span>纣</span><span>王</span><span>的</span><span>叔</span><span>叔</span><span>比</span><span>干</span><span>，</span><span>进</span><span>宫</span><span>劝</span><span>谏</span><span>，</span><span>却</span><span>被</span><span>商</span><span>纣</span><span>王</span><span>挖</span><span>了</span><span>心</span><span>。</span><span>从</span><span>此</span><span>，</span><span>无</span><span>人</span><span>敢</span><span>劝</span><span>谏</span><span>，</span><span>商</span><span>纣</span><span>王</span><span>变</span><span>本</span><span>加</span><span>厉</span><span>，</span><span>修</span><span>造</span><span>鹿</span><span>台</span><span>，</span><span>拉</span><span>老</span><span>百</span><span>姓</span><span>服</span><span>劳</span><span>役</span><span>，</span><span>不</span><span>服</span><span>从</span><span>便</span><span>砍</span><span>头</span><span>、</span><span>剁</span><span>脚</span><span>、</span><span>剖</span><span>腹</span><span>。</span><span>妲</span><span>己</span><span>最</span><span>喜</span><span>欢</span><span>看</span><span>这</span><span>类</span><span>杀</span><span>人</span><span>的</span><span>场</span><span>面</span><span>，</span><span>商</span><span>纣</span><span>王</span><span>也</span><span>乐</span><span>此</span><span>不</span><span>疲</span><span>。</span></p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span>这</span><span>些</span><span>都</span><span>是</span><span>人</span><spa