span><span>强</span><span>大</span><span>。</span><span>季</span><span>历</span><span>死</span><span>后</span><span>，</span><span>他</span><span>的</span><span>儿</span><span>子</span><span>姬</span><span>昌</span><span>继</span><span>位</span><span>。</span><span>姬</span><span>昌</span><span>就</span><span>是</span><span>历</span><span>史</span><span>上</span><span>著</span><span>名</span><span>的</span><span>周</span><span>文</span><span>王</span><span>。</span></p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span>由</span><span>于</span><span>祖</span><span>先</span><span>做</span><span>过</span><span>农</span><span>师</span><span>，</span><span>周</span><span>文</span><span>王</span><span>十</span><span>分</span><span>重</span><span>视</span><span>农</span><span>业</span><span>，</span><span>他</span><span>特</span><span>别</span><span>尊</span><span>重</span><span>有</span><span>本</span><span>领</span><span>的</span><span>人</span><span>，</span><span>请</span><span>他</span><span>们</span><span>帮</span><span>助</span><span>治</span><span>理</span><span>国</span><span>家</span><span>。</span><span>许</span><span>多</span><span>有</span><span>本</span><span>领</span><span>的</span><span>人</span><span>纷</span><span>纷</span><span>来</span><span>投</span><span>奔</span><span>。</span><span>因</span><span>此</span><span>，</span><span>周</span><span>文</span><span>王</span><span>手</span><span>下</span><span>人</span><span>才</span><span>济</span><span>济</span><span>。</span></p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span>商</span><span>纣</span><span>王</span><span>看</span><span>到</span><span>周</span><span>的</span><span>势</span><span>力</span><span>日</span><span>渐</span><span>强</span><span>盛</span><span>，</span><span>感</span><span>到</span><span>害</span><span>怕</span><span>，</span><span>便</span><span>找</span><span>了</span><span>个</span><span>理</span><span>由</span><span>，</span><span>把</span><span>周</span><span>文</span><span>王</span><span>骗</span><span>来</span><span>囚</span><span>禁</span><span>了</span><span>。</span><span>周</span><span>文</span><span>王</span><span>的</span><span>臣</span><span>子</span><span>，</span><span>为</span><span>了</span><span>搭</span><span>救</span><span>周</span><span>文</span><span>王</span><span>，</span><span>搜</span><span>罗</span><span>美</span><span>女</span><span>、</span><span>珍</span><span>宝</span><span>，</span><span>献</span><span>给</span><span>商</span><span>纣</span><span>王</span><span>。</span><span>纣</span><span>王</span><span>贪</span><span>财</span><span>，</span><span>又</span>好色，得了礼物，听了大臣劝解，就把周文王释放了。</p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span>周</span><span>文</span><span>王</span><span>获</span><span>得</span><span>自</span><span>由</span><span>后</span><span>，</span><span>决</span><span>心</span><span>寻</span><span>找</span><span>机</span><span>会</span><span>，</span><span>推</span><span>翻</span><span>商</span><span>朝</span><span>。</span><span>可</span><span>惜</span><span>，</span><span>他</span><span>没</span><span>有</span><span>实</span><span>现</span><span>这</span><span>个</span><span>愿</span><span>望</span><span>就</span><span>死</span><span>去</span><span>了</span><span>。</span><span>他</span><span>的</span><span>儿</span><span>子</span><span>姬</span><span>发</span><span>继</span><span>承</span><span>了</span><span>王</span><span>位</span><span>，</span><span>就</span><span>是</span><span>周</span><span>武</span><span>王</span><span>，</span><span>他</span><span>继</span><span>承</span><span>父</span><span>亲</span><span>的</span><span>遗</span><span>志</span><span>，</span><span>发</span><span>兵</span><span>讨</span><span>伐</span><span>殷</span><span>商</span><span>。</span></p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span>而</span><span>此</span><span>时</span><span>，</span><span>由</span><span>于</span><span>商</span><span>纣</span><span>王</span><span>的</span><span>昏</span><span>庸</span><span>和</span><span>残</span><span>暴</span><span>，</span><span>商</span><span>朝</span><span>原</span><span>本</span><span>忠</span><span>心</span><span>为</span><span>国</span><span>的</span><span>大</span><span>臣</span><span>都</span><span>不</span><span>再</span><span>进</span><span>言</span><span>劝</span><span>谏</span><span>了</span><span>，</span><span>他</span><span>们</span><span>或</span><span>是</span><span>装</span><span>疯</span><span>卖</span><span>傻</span><span>，</span><span>或</span><span>是</span><span>偷</span><span>了</span><span>商</span><span>朝</span><span>太</span><span>庙</span><span>的</span><span>祭</span><span>祀</span><span>工</span><span>具</span><span>，</span><span>前</span><span>去</span><span>投</span><span>奔</span><span>准</span><span>备</span><span>夺</span><span>取</span><span>天</span><span>下</span><span>的</span><span>周</span><span>武</span><span>王</span><span>。</span></p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span>在</span><span>周</span><span>文</span><span>王</span><span>死</span><span>后</span><span>的</span><span>第</span><span>4</span><span>年</span><span>春</span><span>天</span><span>，</span><span>周</span><span>武</span><span>王</span><span>出</span><span>动</span><span>了</span><span>3</span><span>0</span><span>0</span><span>辆</span><span>兵</span><span>车</span><span>，</span><span>3</span><span>0</span><span>0</span><span>0</span><span>名</span><span>勇</span><span>猛</span><span>的</span><span>先</span><span>锋</span><span>和</span><span>4</span><span>万</span><span>多</span><span>名</span><span>士</span><span>兵</span><span>，</span><span>会</span><span>合</span><span>各</span><span>部</span><span>落</span><span>和</span><span>小</span><span>国</span><span>的</span><span>支</span><span>援</span><span>部</span><span>队</span><span>，</span><span>浩</span><span>浩</span><span>荡</span><span>荡</span><span>向</span><span>商</span><span>朝</span><span>的</span><span>都</span><span>城</span><span>朝</span><span>歌</span><span>进</span><span>发</span><span>。</span></p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span>这</span><span>支</span><span>庞</span><span>大</span><span>的</span><span>队</span><span>伍</span><span>，</span><span>一</span><span>路</span><span>都</span><span>没</span><span>遇</span><span>到</span><span>大</span><span>的</span><span>抵</span><span>抗</span><span>，</span><span>就</span><span>到</span><span>了</span><span>离</span><span>朝</span><span>歌</span><span>仅</span><span>有</span><span>7</span><span>0</span><span>里</span><span>路</span><span>的</span><span>牧</span><span>野</span><span>（</span><span>今</span><span>河</span><span>南</span><span>省</span><span>汲</span><span>县</span><span>北</span><span>）</span><span>。</span></p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span>商</span><span>纣</span><span>王</span><span>立</span><span>即</span><span>出</span><span>兵</span><span>，</span><span>在</span><span>牧</span><span>野</span><span>与</span><span>周</span><span>武</span><span>王</span><span>的</span><span>军</span><span>队</span><span>展</span><span>开</span><span>决</span><span>战</span><span>。</span></p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span>这</span><span>场</span><span>牧</span><span>野</span><span>之</span><span>战</span><span>，</span><span>是</span><span>中</span><span>国</span><span>古</span><span>代</span><span>史</span><span>上</span><span>规</span><span>模</span><span>空</span><span>前</span><span>的</span><span>一</span><span>场</span><span>大</span><span>战</span><span>。</span><span>商</span><span>纣</span><span>王</span><span>下</span><span>令</span><span>把</span><span>大</span><span>批</span><span>奴</span><span>隶</span><span>和</span><span>俘</span><span>虏</span><span>编</span><span>入</span><span>军</span><span>队</span><span>，</span><span>一</span><span>共</span><span>7</span><span>0</span><span>万</span><span>人</span><span>，</span><span>而</span><span>周</span><span>武</span><span>王</span><span>的</span><span>讨</span><span>纣</span><span>大</span><span>军</span><span>只</span><span>有</span><span>六</span><span>七</span><span>万</span><span>人</span><span>。</span><span>可</span><span>是</span><span>，</span><span>纣</span><span>王</span><span>军</span><span>队</span><span>人</span><span>数</span><span>虽</span><span>多</span><span>，</span><span>但</span><span>士</span><span>兵</span><span>大</span><span>多</span><span>不</span><span>肯</span><span>为</span><span>纣</span><span>王</span><span>卖</span><span>命</span><span>，</span><span>战</span><span>争</span><span>一</span><span>开</span><span>始</span><span>，</span><span>商</span><span>军</span><span>前</span><span>锋</span><span>部</span><span>队</span><span>便</span><span>倒</span><span>戈</span><span>投</span><span>降</span><span>，</span><span>反</span><span>过</span><span>来</span><span>帮</span><span>助</span><span>周</span><span>军</span><span>攻</span><span>击</span><span>商</span><span>军</span><span>，</span><span>纣</span><span>王</span><span>的</span><span>7</span><span>0</span><span>万</span><span>大</span><span>军</span><span>溃</span><span>不</span><span>成</span><span>军</span><span>。</span><span>纣</span><span>王</span><span>一</span><span>路</span><span>败</span><span>逃</span><span>回</span><span>都</span><span>城</span><span>，</span><span>跑</span><span>上</span><span>鹿</span><span>台</span><span>自</span><span>焚</span><span>，</span><span>与</span><span>搜</span><span>刮</span><span>来</span><span>的</span><span>财</span><span>宝</span><span>一</span><sp