span>作</span><span>威</span><span>作</span><span>福</span><span>了</span><span>，</span><span>于</span><span>是</span><span>，</span><span>他</span><span>们</span><span>对</span><span>周</span><span>朝</span><span>的</span><span>统</span><span>治</span><span>处</span><span>处</span><span>采</span><span>取</span><span>反</span><span>抗</span><span>的</span><span>态</span><span>度</span><span>。</span><span>为</span><span>了</span><span>制</span><span>服</span><span>和</span><span>笼</span><span>络</span><span>他</span><span>们</span><span>，</span><span>周</span><span>武</span><span>王</span><span>把</span><span>商</span><span>朝</span><span>的</span><span>旧</span><span>地</span><span>封</span><span>给</span><span>商</span><span>纣</span><span>王</span><span>的</span><span>儿</span><span>子</span><span>武</span><span>庚</span><span>，</span><span>让</span><span>他</span><span>建</span><span>立</span><span>了</span><span>一</span><span>个</span><span>小</span><span>小</span><span>的</span><span>诸</span><span>侯</span><span>国</span><span>。</span><span>在</span><span>这</span><span>个</span><span>诸</span><span>侯</span><span>国</span><span>的</span><span>范</span><span>围</span><span>里</span><span>，</span><span>仍</span><span>旧</span><span>可</span><span>以</span><span>保</span><span>存</span><span>商</span><span>朝</span><span>的</span><span>太</span><span>庙</span><span>，</span><span>祭</span><span>祀</span><span>商</span><span>朝</span><span>的</span><span>祖</span><span>先</span><span>。</span></p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span>分</span><span>了</span><span>地</span><span>盘</span><span>，</span><span>又</span><span>怕</span><span>武</span><span>庚</span><span>叛</span><span>乱</span><span>，</span><span>周</span><span>武</span><span>王</span><span>又</span><span>想</span><span>出</span><span>一</span><span>个</span><span>办</span><span>法</span><span>，</span><span>那</span><span>就</span><span>是</span><span>把</span><span>商</span><span>